Error: Jet.StateWithoutScreen: No screen of the app graph opens `BoardView`.
  --> Tests/UI/web_route_navigation_to_unknown_route.jet:15:34
    |
 15 | open_board: fn() Never! { app.go(BoardView{project: "p1"}) }
    |                                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Every target runs the program's one app graph, and only a `.screen` whose view takes `BoardView` gives it an address, so a link, push or mail that opens it would open nothing on any target.
 Fix: Register a screen whose view takes `BoardView` in the graph, as `.screen("/path/:field", view)`, or open the state of a screen the graph registers.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.StateWithoutScreen
